    "detailed_description": "&quot;Original Soul&quot; is a top-down action shooting game. There are a certain number of enemies in each mission. You need to use different combat methods to eliminate the enemies before you can complete the level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game, there will be two different beautiful girl heroes to perform tasks. You can choose different female heroes to experience different plots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour mission: free the world from the hordes of &quot;Mad Scientists&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe world of the future is ruled by the Z Corporation founded by a ruthless &quot;mad scientist&quot;. The mad scientist performs his experiments from the headquarters of an evil organization in a cyber city. And created weapons of mass destruction and biomechanical weapons. And the scientist has some kind of mysterious connection with the heroines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo, now it's up to you to control the heroine to save the world from the army of &quot;mad scientists&quot;.",
