    "short_description": "&quot;Shoot, Slash, Dodge&quot; rogue-lite, action shooter dual-core game!! Cyber \u200b\u200bcity in the future world. In order to stop the evil conspiracy of Group Z, Agents Alice and Teresa - under the control of you as the player, fight against the leader of Group Z, Dr. Jacob, and his monsters army.",
